# Wanderlust

Wanderlust is an Airbnb-inspired full-stack web application where users can explore, create, edit, and manage property listings.

The project was built to practice full-stack web development, REST APIs, authentication, database management, image uploads, geocoding, and deployment.

## Live Demo

**Live Application:**
https://wanderlust-ztub.onrender.com

> Note: The application is deployed on Render. The server may take some time to start if it has been inactive.

## Features

### User Authentication

* User signup and login
* Authentication for protected routes
* Session-based authentication
* Users can manage their own listings

### Listings

* View all available listings
* View individual listing details
* Create a new listing
* Edit existing listings
* Delete listings
* Add listing images

### Reviews

* Users can add reviews to listings
* Display reviews on listing pages
* Delete reviews when permitted

### Location & Maps

* Location search and geocoding
* Map integration using Mapbox
* Store listing coordinates using GeoJSON
* Display listing location on the map

### Image Upload

* Image upload using Multer
* Cloudinary integration for cloud image storage

### Validation & Error Handling

* Server-side validation
* Custom error handling
* Protected routes
* User authorization

