## Project Architecture

The application follows a typical MVC-style architecture.

User
 │
 ▼
EJS Views
 │
 ▼
Express Routes
 │
 ▼
Controllers
 │
 ▼
Models / Mongoose
 │
 ▼
MongoDB

Additional services:

Image Upload
     │
     ▼
   Multer
     │
     ▼
 Cloudinary


Location
   │
   ▼
Mapbox Geocoding
   │
   ▼
GeoJSON Coordinates

